type: software
title: "Which modelling choices are supported when marine survey data are limited? Code, data and results"
abstract: "Code and data for an evidence map of 95 studies on species distribution modelling under limited marine survey data, and a benchmark that fits five models to structured subsamples of the NWFSC West Coast Groundfish Bottom Trawl Survey and evaluates them against the held out survey."
